Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.27,0:01:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.21,0:01:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that my goddess?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.47,0:01:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your goddess?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.77,0:01:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you used one\Nof your skills to summon her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.55,0:01:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear me, you insignificant humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.85,0:01:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the twelve goddesses\Nstands before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.43,0:01:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the goddess of night.
