Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry. Were you sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.31,0:02:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When all the lands beyond the veil awaken,\Nthis world shall be filled with darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.87,0:02:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Specifically, my darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.31,0:02:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she's basically saying\NI'm sleepy leave me alone because
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.53,0:02:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it isn't my time yet speech so\Nflowery She needs a translator.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:25.24,0:02:27.79,right,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(279,0)\c&HF1EFEF&\blur0.65\fs150\bord9\fnCandy Cake\3c&HF1EFEF&\pos(1546.82,28.76)\1a&HFF&}Right...
Dialogue: 3,0:02:25.24,0:02:27.79,right,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(279,0)\c&H835A40&\blur0.65\fs150\bord1\fnCandy Cake\3c&H835A40&\pos(1546.82,28.76)\1a&HFF&}Right...
Dialogue: 4,0:02:25.24,0:02:27.79,right,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(279,0)\c&HB36D40&\blur0.65\fs150\bord0\fnCandy Cake\3c&H835A40&\pos(1546.82,28.76)}Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.11,0:02:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh Raven dark servant of mine for what\Nreason have you manifested me this night?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.45,0:02:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it might be called a miracle\Nor maybe destiny or to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.51,0:02:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,put it bluntly you might say\NI called you by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I didn't really have a reason per\Nse to invite me unknowingly on a whim!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.65,0:02:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must admit, such daring is truly\Nfitting for a servant of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.89,0:02:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.81,0:02:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or do Schwartz and\Nthis goddess have the same vibe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already seem like they have a\Nbetter relationship than we do.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.11,0:03:00.36,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(234,473)\fnCandy Cake\fs125\bord8\c&HEAC199&\3c&HEAC199&\1a&HFF&\pos(1374.27,135.04)}Must be nice.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.11,0:03:00.36,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(234,473)\fnCandy Cake\fs125\bord1\c&H835A40&\3c&H835A40&\1a&HFF&\pos(1374.27,135.04)}Must be nice.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.11,0:03:00.36,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(234,473)\fnCandy Cake\fs125\bord0\c&HB16739&\3c&H835A40&\pos(1374.27,135.04)}Must be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.35,0:03:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Schwarz von Liechtenstein-Lohengrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.43,0:03:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.63,0:03:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for the\Nrudeness we've shown you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.27,0:03:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you were the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've been telling you\Nthat this entire time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.47,0:03:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sad little wretched humans proposed\Nthat my darkness-clad hero was false. Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.25,0:03:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's little now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.61,0:03:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.97,0:03:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.21,0:03:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot fall under the\Ncharm of some old guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.31,0:03:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blasted!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.23,0:03:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was taken completely unawares!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.73,0:03:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does this somehow\Nfeel like a violation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.65,0:03:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the hero of the Goddess of Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.47,0:03:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's, uh, that's a thing that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.63,0:03:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're a hero as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.23,0:03:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hero obviously has more\Nspirit and vigor than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've won this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.31,0:04:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm good with losing, but\Ncould I have my clothes back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.13,0:04:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to summon two heroes at once, the\NGoddess of Love has played a cunning hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.97,0:04:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did Tachibana show up\Nhere with another person?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.47,0:04:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, well, my hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.95,0:04:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you first had an audience with\Nme, I asked you something, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.79,0:04:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question was, what do you\Nbelieve to be the strongest of all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.25,0:04:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The strongest what of all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a raven-dark blackness, a void of\Npitch black slicing through everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.53,0:04:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A true blade of darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.63,0:04:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That answer scores a perfect 100!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that answer in turn gave birth\Nto this, the holy sword called Gram.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it was so well made as if it\Nwere the very embodiment of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.21,0:04:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.23,0:04:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This level of excitement is\Nwhat created that weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.89,0:04:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder it turned out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.23,0:04:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does it feel wielding my holy sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.99,0:04:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's undergoing\Nmaintenance right now, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.59,0:04:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.85,0:04:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least you're\Ntaking good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.93,0:05:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great.
