Dialogue: 2,0:05:01.11,0:05:07.45,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H010000&\fs200\fnBrush Strokes\b1\blur0.9\fs300\iclip(m 925.69 295.00 l 925.69 295.00 928.46 290.40 931.51 285.60 934.85 280.64 938.47 275.54 942.38 270.32 946.56 265.01 951.03 259.63 955.77 254.22 960.79 248.79 966.08 243.37 971.65 237.99 977.49 232.67 983.61 227.43 989.99 222.31 996.64 217.32 1000.07 214.89 1003.57 212.50 1007.13 210.16 1010.75 207.86 1014.45 205.62 1018.21 203.44 1022.03 201.32 1025.92 199.25 1029.88 197.26 1033.90 195.33 1037.99 193.48 1042.14 191.70 1046.36 190.00 1050.65 188.38 1054.99 186.84 1059.41 185.40 1063.88 184.04 1068.42 182.78 1073.03 181.62 1077.70 180.56 1082.43 179.59 1087.23 178.74 1092.09 178.00 1097.01 177.37 1102.00 176.86 1107.05 176.47 1112.16 176.19 1117.33 176.05 1122.57 176.03 1127.87 176.15 1133.23 176.40 1138.66 176.79 1144.14 177.32 1149.69 178.00 1149.69 178.00 1159.35 179.98 1164.10 181.06 1168.82 182.20 1173.48 183.43 1178.10 184.73 1182.67 186.13 1187.19 187.63 1191.67 189.23 1196.10 190.94 1200.48 192.77 1204.82 194.73 1209.10 196.83 1213.35 199.07 1217.54 201.46 1221.69 204.00 1221.69 204.00 1222.08 204.20 1222.48 204.42 1222.91 204.67 1223.35 204.94 1223.80 205.23 1224.26 205.55 1224.72 205.89 1225.19 206.25 1225.66 206.64 1226.12 207.05 1226.35 207.26 1226.58 207.48 1226.81 207.71 1227.03 207.94 1227.26 208.18 1227.47 208.42 1227.69 208.67 1227.90 208.92 1228.10 209.18 1228.30 209.45 1228.50 209.72 1228.69 210.00 1228.69 210.00 1237.09 217.89 1245.07 225.84 1252.67 233.94 1256.34 238.06 1259.94 242.25 1263.47 246.50 1266.93 250.84 1270.34 255.26 1273.69 259.78 1277.00 264.41 1280.26 269.14 1286.69 279.00)\pos(1271.02,280.4)}Conscience
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.77,0:05:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Schwartz.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.21,0:05:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If lying hurts your feelings, that\Nmeans there's still hope for your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.99,0:05:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.65,0:05:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the heroes we summon are subsequently\Nbestowed with our blessing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.11,0:05:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as well as the abilities\Nand weapons they wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.99,0:05:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the basic procedure\Nwe have established.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.95,0:05:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.73,0:05:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we ever get to see our goddess again,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.83,0:05:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then maybe I can get one of\Nthose super powerful weapons too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.83,0:05:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.17,0:05:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The strongest of all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.71,0:05:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mischievous inner child is\Nthreatening to come out to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.65,0:05:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going back to the question\Nof why the two of us
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.09,0:05:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were summoned here together\NI believe the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.05,0:05:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that I am considered to be your\Nweapon Tachibana whoa you grasp things
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.55,0:05:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,quickly human child hold up a minute\Nno no this isn't right what isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.01,0:05:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right I mean this is ridiculous isn't\Nit seriously if it's true that means
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:06:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're the strongest of all not me\NTachibana I didn't know you thought of me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.61,0:06:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put that smile off your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.23,0:06:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never thought anything so\Nembarrassing in my entire life!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.23,0:06:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I got summoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you probably just got caught up in it\Nbecause you were nearby, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.73,0:06:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late to take it back, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.05,0:06:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.97,0:06:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, at a time like this,\Nyou bothered to counterattack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.21,0:06:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.45,0:06:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.85,0:06:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two get along really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.17,0:06:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Audrey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, honored hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you marry me so we can be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.61,0:06:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.93,0:06:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are two heroes gathered here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is when the myths begin once\Nmore, then I shall become your pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.57,0:06:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be your bridge to\Nthe world of politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.23,0:06:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wondered why his lordship\Nhadn't gotten charmed by you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.11,0:06:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but with the villagers,\Nit was religious belief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.07,0:06:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next was the jealousy of the elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.15,0:07:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it was the drive to\Nprotect with the interrogator.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With his lordship, it's\Nhis wish for success.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.99,0:07:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems likely that the\Neffect of your beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.39,0:07:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stirs different desires\Nin different people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So in his case, your beauty, coupled with\Nyour standing as hero, finally broke him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.71,0:07:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But are you okay with that, Jinguuji?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if that's true, then it means you've\Nbeen charmed by my most obvious aspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.71,0:07:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up, Jinguuji?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are so into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.89,0:07:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I not good enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.49,0:07:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With your beauty and\Nmy knowledge combined,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.11,0:07:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could control the\Nentire economy together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.43,0:07:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to love me, but let's get\Nout there and save business and politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguuji?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.63,0:07:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your actions will only\Ninvite certain destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.63,0:07:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Certain destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.01,0:07:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Certain destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.31,0:07:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you mean to interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be clear, you two aren't\Na couple or anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what motivated\Nme to deliver that warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.87,0:08:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.71,0:08:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I may have your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, this is, after\Nall, medical treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.87,0:08:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the most efficient way to\Nremedy contamination of the psyche.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.23,0:08:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are we done?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.59,0:08:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go back home. Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.65,0:08:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.45,0:08:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's come to pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This spot where the goddess\Ndescended is now Holy Land!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.31,0:08:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shall embrace the night\Nand prosper as a town where
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.99,0:08:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,travelers can stop and rest\Nsafely with no fear at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.47,0:08:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess in the end it was kinda good\Nthat you called down the goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.83,0:08:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I definitely wondered how\Nthings would turn out at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.21,0:08:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.47,0:08:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to ask for your\Nhelp in developing our town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.89,0:08:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can provide land, a place to\Nlive, and funds, among other things!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.59,0:08:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.23,0:08:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, do you mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.01,0:09:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have to worry about\Nfood or a place to sleep anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I accept, by all means!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, basically he'd be our patron.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.81,0:09:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Miss Audrey, if you would also\Nconsider staying on as a public symbol,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can promise you three square\Nmeals and a nap per day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, you've gone and offered me\Nexactly the kind of reward I would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.11,0:09:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That seriously calls to a\Nworking adult's tired heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.73,0:09:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know, what\Ndo you think, Jinguji?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I'm actually against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.89,0:09:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why though?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.45,0:09:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we don't do anything, we\Nget three square meals and a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.79,0:09:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what everyone can tell dreams of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.03,0:09:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't say I've ever dreamed of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.19,0:09:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And his lordship didn't say\Nwe wouldn't have to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.91,0:09:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he said I just have\Nto stay here. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.15,0:09:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is stay and\Nentertain the important people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.93,0:09:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Basically, you're a honey trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you'll work at\Nnight, so sure, take a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.77,0:09:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.45,0:10:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But staying in one place is going\Nto be difficult for you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once people learn of your\Npresence, you'll be forced to flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.15,0:10:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People will hunt you\Ndown to use or kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.55,0:10:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but if it means I get to go back\Nto who I was even a second sooner,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I think I should make use of\Nwhatever method might be available to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.85,0:10:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.77,0:10:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if there's like some kind of dangerous\Ndanger or whatever, you should protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.07,0:10:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if you get poisoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we need a food taster,\Nwe have schmarzzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.85,0:10:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, all I know right now is that I\Ndon't want to hike any more mountain paths!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I mean, your reasons\Ndo seem legitimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His head's immersed in the\Nconvenience of the modern era.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.31,0:10:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Tachibana,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not opposed to strengthening\Nour pipeline to influential people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.89,0:10:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're certain to obtain a fair amount\Nof useful information if we stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.63,0:10:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, if we do stay, could we\Nstill claim we're traveling freely?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have earned a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.31,0:10:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been so busy with work and life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.35,0:10:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When's the last time we took it easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.15,0:11:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody's even watching us, so\Nwhy not kick back for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.33,0:11:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't logical,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.49,0:11:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm fully aware that there's an\Nobvious bias to my thoughts on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.65,0:11:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume that has something\Nto do with how much
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.89,0:11:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've enjoyed this sense\Nof being on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.53,0:11:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is why I'm not ready\Nto accept this offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.93,0:11:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.31,0:11:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what are your\Nthoughts on it, Tachibana?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're gonna put it that way,\Nthere's not much I can say, is there?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.03,0:11:30.04,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\c&HE6E5E6&\3c&HE6E5E6&\fs100\bord4\blur0.65\fnRevans Medium\b0\pos(945,731)}The Next Day
Dialogue: 2,0:11:27.03,0:11:30.04,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H090908&\3c&HE6E5E6&\fs100\bord0\blur0.7\fnRevans Medium\b0\pos(945,731)}The Next Day
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.63,0:11:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, bye! Thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.07,0:11:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, I was finally able\Nto obtain a map of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take two weeks to get\Nto the royal capital, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.13,0:11:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.75,0:11:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we'd done exactly as that lord said,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.13,0:11:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he might have let us use\Nofficial transportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.53,0:11:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jinguuji, when we turned it down,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.09,0:11:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that emotional bias\Nyou were talking about,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's actually called being strong-willed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.95,0:12:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not such a petty,\Nchildish person as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.51,0:12:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is that you're more\Nchildish than anyone ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.97,0:12:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I can't let that comment slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.81,0:12:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to explain\Nwhat you meant by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.49,0:12:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go to the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.09,0:12:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see what I saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.95,0:12:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we just decide to pretend we didn't?
