Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.19,0:12:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a dream about when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.43,0:12:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In it, my vision was blurred with tears,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.95,0:12:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm guessing it might not\Nhave been a very good dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.97,0:12:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I looked up at the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.93,0:12:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw the light lance\Ndown through the trees
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.89,0:12:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I remember the piercing\Nsound of the cicadas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.97,0:13:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there was this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.21,0:13:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When was it when we first\Nstarted being friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to go now, Tachibana?
