Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right, I had forgotten that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.69,0:13:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so incomprehensible\Nit actually frightened me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.19,0:13:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you were choosing between\Nthis and becoming a woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.03,0:13:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd have preferred the cellophane tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.03,0:13:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably would have been less complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.81,0:13:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, here, I want you to look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.95,0:13:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you take with you to\Nbe stranded on a desert island?
