Dialogue: 2,0:13:49.59,0:13:49.64,Signs,Track,0,0,0,,{=6}{\fscx90.78\fscy90.78\alpha&H00&\4c&H282828&\blur0.75\fs225\frz-18.34\fnCrayonara\c&H282828&\an2\fax-0.16\b0\pos(918.45,642.17)}Jinguuji
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.69,0:13:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't choose you because you\Nwere the most powerful weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I chose you because I\Nthought you'd be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.29,0:13:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.63,0:14:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's what you want to\Nthink, then I suppose it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.71,0:14:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to clear up\Nyour misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.39,0:14:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, sure, I get it, but unfortunately\Nwe can't summon the goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.03,0:14:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's no value debating\Nsomething we have no way of knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.73,0:14:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, that's a survey\Nfrom elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still want to become cellophane tape?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow, I highly doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what do you know\Nabout cellophane tape?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One thing I do know is that you\Ndon't know anything about it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be condescending to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.19,0:14:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to assume that you had a\Nway more brilliant dream as a kid then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.27,0:14:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.19,0:14:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.59,0:14:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.51,0:14:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm embarrassed, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you really believe you\Ndeserve to escape this
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after openly making fun\Nof someone else's dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.89,0:14:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put it down, you idiot! Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.07,0:14:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do to my book?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.17,0:14:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for being so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.89,0:14:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.91,0:14:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't you let me read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.27,0:14:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you expect after you\Nlaughed at me back when I wrote it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.13,0:14:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.87,0:15:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I know I went\Na bit far crossing it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.91,0:15:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you were being pretty\Nchildish, too, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.69,0:15:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm like, I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.71,0:15:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need a little\Nbreak from talking to you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.05,0:15:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about what you did\Nyou do with an eggplant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.59,0:15:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you are An eggplant in a suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.47,0:15:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.99,0:15:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the heck scribbles\Nover something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was jinguchi's dream anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.39,0:15:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot. I wish I could remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.71,0:15:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brain is just so
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.27,0:15:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.55,0:15:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eggplant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.39,0:15:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do they love squid so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.01,0:15:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, what a lovely couple you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.95,0:15:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Care for some squid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.95,0:15:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not a couple and\Nwe don't need squid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.25,0:15:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, are you fighting right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.11,0:15:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite a shame, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.29,0:15:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But come on, it's squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you listening, young people?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When your heart is feeling prickly, that's\Nwhen you need to eat something tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.97,0:16:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, try our specialty in makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.89,0:16:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, give it a try, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.27,0:16:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.19,0:16:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.10,0:16:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, my guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.91,0:16:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what grilled squid needs is beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.67,0:16:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I open up a can, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, since the proprietor\Nis probably right,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.65,0:16:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will we just agree that we were both\Nbeing childish and leave it at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.77,0:16:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I went too far using that marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since we're living together,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would really appreciate it if you would\Nrespect my privacy a little bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.85,0:16:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's not cool to ignore me, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.63,0:16:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you listening, Tachibana? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.17,0:16:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is a joke, it's\Nin really bad taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.59,0:16:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The squid shot guy is gone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could this be a kidnapping?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.53,0:16:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, calm down, Jinguuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll feel ridiculous if you're shaken\Njust because you can't see anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.35,0:16:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're talking about Tachibana here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.67,0:16:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the kind of person who'd be\Nlaughing and sneering at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.53,0:16:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.45,0:17:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of payback for\Nwhat I did to the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.73,0:17:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If so, I think the best
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.69,0:17:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing I can do is to\Nshow that I'm panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.91,0:17:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I pretend I've been\Ntaken in by this, that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.21,0:17:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ridiculous, but giving mental\Nsupport is the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana doesn't even realize I'm the one
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.39,0:17:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who has everything in the palm of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.61,0:17:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, my wanting
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to control this much is\Ndefinitely all about my own ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.07,0:17:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This squid is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.35,0:17:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even if I don't fuss and\Nworry, Tachibana's a grown adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.43,0:17:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for that effect on others,\Nnone of this would even be a concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.03,0:17:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That cart...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the one the premier was on.
