Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.65,0:17:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, that wasn't\Na very enjoyable job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.57,0:17:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the pay was good, so I\Njust need to shake this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.15,0:18:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to my cart?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So are you the owner of this vehicle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.43,0:18:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only meant to take a little look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.55,0:18:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't intend to destroy it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my hands won't seem to stop shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.61,0:18:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, first, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.53,0:18:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am completely calm, as\NI believe you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.47,0:18:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm actually incredibly calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.57,0:18:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, you could say\Nthat I am far too calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.11,0:18:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would a calm person destroy a cart?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.39,0:18:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an herb that people use to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.49,0:18:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will happily give it to\Nyou for free. Smell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.17,0:18:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a slave trader?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.89,0:18:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had an elf woman on\Nthis cart, did you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my specialty,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.07,0:18:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you can think of me as a trader\Nwho deals in a wide variety of goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why were you looking for that elf?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.45,0:18:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, the person I'm looking for is\Na blonde, blue-eyed young woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.65,0:19:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have any idea where I might find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.37,0:19:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, I don't deal in kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.35,0:19:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, but could it be that\Nshe's very beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.89,0:19:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.01,0:19:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And did she disappear in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.55,0:19:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it might be best for\Nyou to hurry on your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.09,0:19:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking that it's been a while
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.11,0:19:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since I did a job like\Nthis that I didn't enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the elf I delivered\Nwas really beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.79,0:19:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know they'd\Nuse her as a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.01,0:19:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's your big plan,\Nbringing me to a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.99,0:19:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.33,0:19:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you already know, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.65,0:19:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this really happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.31,0:19:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has this all been leading to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a human male whose desires\Nare clear for anyone to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.41,0:19:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be even more strange if this\Ndidn't lead to something like that.
