Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.65,0:19:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this where my journey ends?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.57,0:19:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, subjects of my village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.37,0:19:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I'm to be sullied,\NI'd rather kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.29,0:19:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you plan to do as you\Nlike with me, I'd rather die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.77,0:19:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.53,0:20:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you are a sacrifice, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.09,0:20:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.57,0:20:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.73,0:20:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tonight, after the festival\Nends, you'll be an offering.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.11,0:20:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I really am going\Nto die? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.71,0:20:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it really would be\Nsuch a terrible waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.89,0:20:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That perfectly well-balanced figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.83,0:20:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and those eyes with such intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.53,0:20:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fine skin and cheeks\Nand lips like roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Endlessly brimming with\Nmysterious elegance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the first time in my life that\NI've seen so beautiful a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.09,0:20:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.07,0:20:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How fascinating that there are\Nhumans who understand my beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what you're saying is, you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the offering must be beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.85,0:20:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, very good, you've got that correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.15,0:20:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our deity does require that\Nbeautiful people be sacrificed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.93,0:20:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while there were a good\Nhandful of other candidates,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.01,0:20:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were unanimously chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.75,0:20:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.01,0:20:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was unanimous that I should die?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.01,0:21:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose since I've been\Nchosen, there's nothing to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess being too beautiful\Nreally is a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.69,0:21:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this, this is the\Npunishment I'm receiving for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.47,0:21:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a strange heat to\Nthe way this man looks at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.65,0:21:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that I look more closely, he\Nmight give up a manly, handsome vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.61,0:21:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.73,0:21:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man must be in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.27,0:21:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.31,0:21:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I may have to use my allure to\Nmanipulate him in order to make my escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.89,0:21:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's Beauty, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.43,0:21:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.51,0:21:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I need to project it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.91,0:21:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.11,0:21:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or like this? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.01,0:21:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's making strange poses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.95,0:21:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just need to behave yourself\Nuntil you're sacrificed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.25,0:21:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That girl there, the sacrifice?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.27,0:21:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure about that, Henry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.97,0:21:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meggie, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What business are you about when\Nwe already have our sacrifice?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.87,0:21:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right, we certainly do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.15,0:21:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if there were a girl who is\Neven more beautiful than that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.31,0:22:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.39,0:22:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you!
